[{"speaker":"","text":"我们的二人的声音，在“最爱”两字上重合了。","art":{"background":"a3909","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"这么听着，还是有些难为情，我不禁露出了苦笑。","art":{"background":"a3909","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-1"},{"speaker":"","text":"但尽管如此，我依然紧紧地抱着蕾娜。","art":{"background":"a3909","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「就这样抱一会儿吧……先不要分开哦」","art":{"background":"a3909","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-1"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「当然了……今晚，我们就牵着手入眠吧？」","art":{"background":"a3909","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-1"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嘿嘿……没问题♪我最喜欢你了，将臣」","art":{"background":"a3909","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-1"}]